#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:5
#: ddc87ceb2ae24d0f8ac7a443572687a2
msgid "BotBlox DroneNet"
msgstr "BotBlox DroneNet"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:11
#: d84aeec3112641d8ac1759cec9f7b8b7
msgid ""
"The `BotBlox DroneNet <https://botblox.io/dronenet-for-ardupilot/>`__ "
"ethernet adapter allows STM32 H7 autopilots without built-in ethernet "
"support to connect to ethernet peripherals"
msgstr ""
"`BotBlox DroneNet <https://botblox.io/dronenet-for-ardupilot/>`__ "
"以太网适配器可让没有内置以太网支持的STM32 H7飞控连接以太网外设。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:14
#: 9108ced078054ec28d1559d94fad1457
msgid "Where To Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:16
#: 02318b160ccd4d2388e7d6719229414f
msgid ""
"The `BotBlox DroneNet can be purchased directly from BotBlox "
"<https://botblox.io/dronenet-for-ardupilot/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`BotBlox DroneNet 可直接从BotBlox购买 <https://botblox.io/dronenet-for-"
"ardupilot/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:18
#: 83907792592a4b9d98a92148c423aa1d
msgid ""
"Optionally the `SwitchBlox Cable Adapter <https://botblox.io/switchblox-"
"cable-adapter-for-ardupilot/>`__ may be useful to ease the ethernet port "
"differences across device manufacturers"
msgstr ""
"可选配 `SwitchBlox 线缆适配器 <https://botblox.io/switchblox-cable-adapter-for-"
"ardupilot/>`__，有助于解决不同设备厂商以太网接口差异的问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:21
#: eeeac2b8844a488f808cc4a685411318
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接至飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:27
#: f853d27c832f4a0ba2f7794366e3deef
msgid ""
"Connect one of the autopilot's serial ports to the DroneNet's UART port. For"
" optimum performance the autopilot's serial port should support flow control"
" which normally means using Serial1 or Serial2.  In the image above Serial2 "
"is used."
msgstr ""
"将飞控的某个串口连接至DroneNet的UART接口。为获得最佳性能，飞控串口应支持流控制，通常使用Serial1或Serial2。上图中使用了Serial2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:29
#: a220a15e75054bdbbc974859453d7500
msgid ""
"Connect one of the autopilot's CAN ports to the DroneNet's CAN port.  This "
"connection is only used to configure the DroneNet device and so it maybe "
"removed after the configuration is completed.  In the image above the "
"autopilot's CAN1 is used."
msgstr ""
"将飞控的某个CAN接口连接至DroneNet的CAN接口。此连接仅用于配置DroneNet设备，配置完成后可断开。上图中使用了飞控的CAN1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:31
#: e950cb68c8dd44dd96f284b26125d0fb
msgid ""
"5V Power can be provided through the dedicated power port or through the "
"Serial or CAN port"
msgstr "5V供电可通过专用电源接口，或通过串口或CAN接口提供。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:34
#: 7d08cb6cf1c74ff8abeb47e53350052c
msgid "Install ArduPilot with PPP Support"
msgstr "安装含PPP支持的ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:36
#: 9359948755dc40b5ad67aeecbe266b10
msgid ""
"`PPP <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Point-to-"
"Point_Protocol_over_Ethernet>`__ allows an autopilot to communicate over "
"Ethernet using a serial port but with the exception of the CubePilot "
"CubeOrangePlus, PPP is not included by default in the ArduPilot firmware."
msgstr ""
"`PPP <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Point-to-"
"Point_Protocol_over_Ethernet>`__ 允许飞控通过串口使用以太网通信，但除CubePilot "
"CubeOrangePlus外，ArduPilot固件默认不包含PPP支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:38
#: 19610737bd7b4ef5b7963819767622c3
msgid ""
"Use the `Custom Firmware Build Server <https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__ to "
"build a firmware that includes PPP support"
msgstr "使用 `自定义固件编译服务器 <https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__ 构建包含PPP支持的固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:43
#: 13e18becf7fa406eac48af0a097a9952
msgid ""
"Alternatively :ref:`build the code yourself <building-the-code>` and enable "
"PPP by adding ``--enable-PPP`` to the waf configuration step"
msgstr ""
"或 :ref:`自行编译代码 <building-the-code>`，在waf配置步骤中添加 ``--enable-PPP`` 来启用PPP。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:44
#: 4f93a7b9f74d4123adf3f5100ba15eae
msgid ""
":ref:`Install the firmware on the autopilot <common-loading-firmware-onto-"
"pixhawk>`"
msgstr ":ref:`将固件安装到飞控 <common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:47
#: 87b96369297f4a7ab9831605224b087e
msgid "Autopilot Configuration"
msgstr "飞控配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:49
#: 6fea3171598846109345097487103eb9
msgid ""
"See the ``PPP configuration`` and ``ArduPilot Port Configuration`` sections "
"of :ref:`common-network` but in short set these parameters:"
msgstr ""
"请参阅 :ref:`common-network` 中的 ``PPP配置`` 和 ``ArduPilot端口配置`` 章节，简要设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:51
#: 760078b4177c43ecae794f456e86459d
msgid ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (First driver)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（第一驱动）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:52
#: bea5aa30e8284e09871ae6f5cc2881be
msgid ":ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 1 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 1（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:53
#: e98bd4efaef34b5eb5609c32474a92ea
msgid ":ref:`NET_ENABLE <NET_ENABLE>` = 1"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_ENABLE <NET_ENABLE>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:54
#: 365cda031914417baff3323661efd45c
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 48 (PPP)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 48（PPP）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:55
#: e1903c780f71411cba3010e3b915d54b
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 12500000 (12.5MBaud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 12500000（12.5MBaud）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:57
#: ec925aae694a4833bc22ff803acbc9e8
msgid ""
"To allow the autopilot to eventually communicate with other ethernet "
"devices, the :ref:`NET_P1_TYPE <NET_P1_TYPE>`, :ref:`NET_P1_PROTOCOL "
"<NET_P1_PROTOCOL>`, etc parameters will need to be set. More details on the "
"settings required can be found in the \"Ethernet Conectivity\" sections of "
"the ArduPilot wiki page for the device.  For example :ref:`Siyi camera "
"setups can be found on this page <common-siyi-zr10-gimbal>`"
msgstr ""
"为使飞控最终能与其他以太网设备通信，需设置 :ref:`NET_P1_TYPE <NET_P1_TYPE>`、:ref:`NET_P1_PROTOCOL"
" <NET_P1_PROTOCOL>` 等参数。有关具体设置的更多详情，可在ArduPilot维基对应设备的「以太网连接」章节中找到。例如 "
":ref:`Siyi 相机设置可在此页面找到 <common-siyi-zr10-gimbal>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:61
#: b6dfb66b45e94e3ea32067f5b321aafc
msgid "DroneNet Setup"
msgstr "DroneNet配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:66
#: bf0b1d80443f49609e8157f473dde23b
msgid ""
"The DroneNet's parameters can be set using Mission Planner's DroneCAN screen"
" or the :ref:`DroneCAN GUI tool <common-uavcan-gui>`.  The following "
"instructions assume Mission Planner is used:"
msgstr ""
"DroneNet的参数可通过Mission Planner的DroneCAN页面或 :ref:`DroneCAN GUI工具 <common-"
"uavcan-gui>` 设置。以下说明以Mission Planner为例："

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:68
#: 6cc04cf965df428aa191e3bd1f24e6de
msgid "Connect to the AutoPilot with Mission Planner"
msgstr "使用Mission Planner连接飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:69
#: dfe4cba7bdad4cf49d13b2b21794f24a
msgid "Open the Setup, Optional Hardware, DroneCAN/UAVCAN screen"
msgstr "打开设置、可选硬件、DroneCAN/UAVCAN页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:70
#: a11f186af70c428cbf25af9084ed3a71
msgid ""
"From the top-left drop-down select MAVLinkCAN1 (or MAVLinkCAN2 if the "
"autopilot's CAN2 is used)"
msgstr "在左上角下拉菜单中选择MAVLinkCAN1（若使用飞控CAN2则选MAVLinkCAN2）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:71
#: b65dd5e9f993412ea1b3fff95fe04f28
msgid ""
"Press \"Connect\" and the table should be populated with the available "
"DroneCAN devices including \"org.ardupilot.BotBloxDroneNet\""
msgstr "点击 「Connect」，表格中将显示可用的DroneCAN设备，包括 「org.ardupilot.BotBloxDroneNet」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:72
#: a518d8ab205341f1ac5b91beebdbb734
msgid "Press the \"Menu\" button on the right side and select \"Parameters\""
msgstr "点击右侧的 「Menu」 按钮，选择 「Parameters」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:73
#: ff3f0807a15e4b748639665a557188aa
msgid "Set the following parameters and press the \"Write\" button"
msgstr "设置以下参数后，点击 「Write」 按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:75
#: ce3aa7f9dac646eb8a611550537ab4b1
msgid ":ref:`NET_DHCP <NET_DHCP>` = 0 (to disable dynamic IP assignment)"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_DHCP <NET_DHCP>` = 0（禁用动态IP分配）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:76
#: 9c50be768c1b4b648d0afd0338a1ba83
msgid ":ref:`NET_IPADDR0 <NET_IPADDR0>` = 192 (default)"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_IPADDR0 <NET_IPADDR0>` = 192（默认）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:77
#: 4c4ea2f7b63a45e6810c2ac3c12e298a
msgid ":ref:`NET_IPADDR1 <NET_IPADDR1>` = 168 (default)"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_IPADDR1 <NET_IPADDR1>` = 168（默认）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:78
#: 52566414078f44d6a03b7de76257a1cb
msgid ":ref:`NET_IPADDR2 <NET_IPADDR2>` = 144"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_IPADDR2 <NET_IPADDR2>` = 144"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:79
#: 91984239cd52428197bfbb52a3e3d2b6
msgid ":ref:`NET_IPADDR3 <NET_IPADDR3>` = 14"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_IPADDR3 <NET_IPADDR3>` = 14"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:80
#: 3d5c9aa3b58f4609a8264ccae4efb701
msgid ":ref:`NET_GWADDR0 <NET_GWADDR0>` = 192 (default)"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_GWADDR0 <NET_GWADDR0>` = 192（默认）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:81
#: 7ed867fd1dc842c1a6c45822b9038742
msgid ":ref:`NET_GWADDR1 <NET_GWADDR1>` = 168 (default)"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_GWADDR1 <NET_GWADDR1>` = 168（默认）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:82
#: 20830de977c24c6f8f02ae93ec9de58f
msgid ":ref:`NET_GWADDR2 <NET_GWADDR2>` = 144"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_GWADDR2 <NET_GWADDR2>` = 144"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:83
#: f74d584dc722410cabff4664e3556c29
msgid ":ref:`NET_GWADDR3 <NET_GWADDR3>` = 1"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_GWADDR3 <NET_GWADDR3>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:85
#: 9d2ce87f1b3644ee9524f8c4dfde64a9
msgid "Reboot the system or from the DroneCAN screen select \"Menu\", \"Restart\""
msgstr "重启系统，或在DroneCAN页面选择 「Menu」、「Restart」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:86
#: 0c4617c2e7dc4382b152c56ce7076a94
msgid ""
"On the next autopilot reboot, messages like those shown below should appear."
"  Note that the autopilot's IP address's final octet is one higher (e.g. "
"\"15\") than the DroneNet's IP address (e.g. \"14\")"
msgstr "飞控下次重启时，应出现如下所示的消息。注意飞控IP地址的最后一段（如 「15」）比DroneNet的IP地址（如 「14」）大1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:91
#: fc44e0163ba84ed6a57982437f934bb3
msgid ""
"The IP addresses chosen above are somewhat arbitrary but work well for many "
"systems.  In general all ethernet devices on the drone should be in the same"
" subnet meaning the first three octets of the IP address (e.g. "
"192.168.144.x) should match while the last octet should be unique to each "
"device."
msgstr ""
"上述IP地址的选择有一定随意性，但对多数系统均有效。通常情况下，无人机上所有以太网设备应处于同一子网，即IP地址的前三段（如192.168.144.x）应相同，最后一段对每台设备应唯一。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:94
#: e11c88877fa34ef494fdd592239e239e
msgid "DroneNet WebServer"
msgstr "DroneNet Web服务器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:96
#: 3a7851d26b4e45b4b1556fe06ee2b6b0
msgid ""
"The DroneNet device has a built-in web server that can be used to update the"
" firmware on the device"
msgstr "DroneNet设备内置Web服务器，可用于更新设备固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:101
#: fbedb290f20142d0b8491906a079a504
msgid "Connect a PC to the DroneNet's ethernet"
msgstr "将PC连接至DroneNet的以太网接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:102
#: 783fa30d0d5e431a969e8b2820ca64cd
msgid ""
"Set the PC's IP address to be in the same subnet as the DroneNet (e.g. "
"192.168.144.99)"
msgstr "将PC的IP地址设置为与DroneNet同一子网（如192.168.144.99）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:103
#: ab0816e74711405ea9c17684a7d55ee0
msgid ""
"Open a web browser and enter the DroneNet's IP address as the URL (e.g. "
"\"192.168.144.14\")"
msgstr "打开浏览器，输入DroneNet的IP地址作为URL（如 「192.168.144.14」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botblox-dronenet.rst:104
#: d58b215378c64ad3b4f2cedcbcf98e5b
msgid ""
"See the video linked below for more details on how to use the webserver to "
"update the DroneNet's firmware"
msgstr "有关如何使用Web服务器更新DroneNet固件的详细说明，请参阅下方视频链接。"

